{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jingle and clatter\u2014\u2014! This is your very own private coin pusher arcade!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Pusher Simulator is an immersive simulation game that perfectly recreates the experience of arcade coin pushers. What you hear is the crisp sound of coins colliding, what you see is a precarious mountain of prizes, and what you feel is the nervousness of sweating palms when making that crucial push!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have recreated the luster of every inch of metal, the trajectory of every coin, and even the slightly laggy retro joystick of the machine! But this is more than just a cold simulation\u2014\u2014because you have a vibrant &quot;mascot girl&quot; [Xiao Ji] accompanying you throughout! Play solo and enjoy the purest, stress-free fun of coin pushing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop a coin, awaken memories, and the story between you and &quot;Xiao Ji&quot; begins now!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Ultimate Realism, Perfect Replication\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a real physics engine, it replicates every detail of the arcade coin pusher in a 1:1 ratio: the stacking, sliding, and collapsing of coins, as well as the flipping and falling of prizes, are exactly the same as what you remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully designed multiple classic game tables, from &quot;Small Line Bonus&quot; to &quot;Full Board Bonus&quot;, each with a unique coin layout and prize array.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Your Exclusive Mascot Girl: [Xiao Ji]\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a cute &quot;Coin Pusher Ji&quot; mascot girl on the machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Pure Solo Fun, No Payment Pressure\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the most authentic gameplay of the arcade! In-game coins can be easily obtained through playing, no additional payment is required, and all luck and skills are just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Rich Achievement System\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Steam achievements to prove that you are the true &quot;King of Coin Pushers&quot; and &quot;Destiny's Lucky One&quot;.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Operation Instructions</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Spacebar\u3011</strong>: Insert coin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010F1\u3011</strong>: Enter or exit the best viewing angle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010F2\u3011</strong>: Turn the wiper on or off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010F3\u3011</strong>: Resolve coin jamming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Right Mouse Button\u3011</strong>: Click the machine to open the menu bar</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Born God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3965810/f01614b4e63ef1a50903f900f4167bd21ffbf4e6.jpg"},{"name":"Path to Heaven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3965810/97d09fa166b63682078468987f8120d59f24d655.jpg"},{"name":"Perseverance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3965810/b243310bc12fddee080ac981f365cde5a24e2c3d.jpg"},{"name":"Four Directions Supreme","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3965810/c0da4ccf85b4787c7de9bfcfb0ae76d5ef304960.jpg"},{"name":"Royal Power Heavenly Lord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3965810/209f49d1cb08d7f0034e40b394baff8a75a65225.jpg"},{"name":"Divine Court Ruler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3965810/d207b17ccd382d