ed the luster of every inch of metal, the trajectory of every coin, and even the slightly laggy retro joystick of the machine! But this is more than just a cold simulation\u2014\u2014because you have a vibrant &quot;mascot girl&quot; [Xiao Ji] accompanying you throughout! Play solo and enjoy the purest, stress-free fun of coin pushing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop a coin, awaken memories, and the story between you and &quot;Xiao Ji&quot; begins now!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Ultimate Realism, Perfect Replication\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a real physics engine, it replicates every detail of the arcade coin pusher in a 1:1 ratio: the stacking, sliding, and collapsing of coins, as well as the flipping and falling of prizes, are exactly the same as what you remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully designed multiple classic game tables, from &quot;Small Line Bonus&quot; to &quot;Full Board Bonus&quot;, each with a unique coin layout and prize array.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Your Exclusive Mascot Girl: [Xiao Ji]\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a cute &quot;Coin Pusher Ji&quot; mascot girl on the machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Pure Solo Fun, No Payment Pressure\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the most authentic gameplay of the arcade! In-game coins can be easily obtained through playing, no additional payment is required, and all luck and skills are just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Rich Achievement System\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Steam achievements to prove that you are the true &quot;King of Coin Pushers&quot; and &quot;Destiny's Lucky One&quot;.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Operation Instructions</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Spacebar\u3011</strong>: Insert coin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010F1\u3011</strong>: Enter or exit the best viewing angle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010F2\u3011</strong>: Turn the wiper on or off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010F3\u3011</strong>: Resolve coin jamming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Right Mouse Button\u3011</strong>: Click the machine to open the menu bar</p></li></ul>","developers":["N-height"],"dlc":[4226660],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965810/7cc8148ab3604e6b3f5e66c742ff5c14ba423563/header.jpg?t=1766996555","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3965810/575567560/04d005c0a4c624d4cd99437e430d1714556507de/1757072132/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757079199","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3965810/575567560/04d005c0a4c624d4cd99437e430d1714556507de/1757072132/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757079199","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3965810/575567560/04d005c0a4c624d4cd99437e430d1714556507de/1757072132/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757079199","id":257193646,"name":"\u89c6\u98913","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257193646/2af84888ba2321230f87dfc15f89f77a3714f8f8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757079199"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3965810/2009170701/d15bc6bf47806227e6c9bef0f6bfef2fdadc9327/1757070226/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757079202","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3965810/2009170701/d15bc6bf47806227e6c9bef0f6bfef2fdadc9327/1757070226/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757079202","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/